  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n +\n ÷\n -\n ×\n \n \n\n Stands For\n -\n +\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\nGiven: 18/6 - 2 + 8 = ?\n\n18/6 - 2 + 8 = ? ⇒ 18 + 6 × 2 - 8 = ?\n\n⇒ 18 + __**6 **____**×**____** 2**__ - 8 = ?\n\n⇒ **__18 + 1__****__2__** - 8 = ?\n\n⇒ __**30**____** - 8**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 22 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
